

How security pipeline work:

    first initiate firebase app in firebaseconfig

    then we write our own firebasefilter, and register it in securtiyconfig

    securityconfig is only applied on api path

    security config configure the cors and the authorization

    user send a request from their browser to firebase if cridentials are correct

    firebase auth responds with jwt token and the user sends this to backend

    backend verifies the signature and authenticate users.
